<title>USA: Parlux sets 500,000 share buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Parlux sets 500,000 share buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parlux Fragrances Inc Thursday said its board has authorized the repurchase of 500,000 shares of the company's stock, as the second phase of a common stock open market buyback program.</p>
<p>The company said it recently completed the first phase of its program involving 350,000 shares.</p>
<p>Parlux Fragrances manufactures and distributes fragrances, cosmetics and related beauty products.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
